    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm mostly hearing about the costs from people in the industry though. do you think the \"green market opportunities\" you mentioned are actually a realistic thing for a small shop to bank on, or is that more of a theoretical thing that won't really offset the massive compliance bills they're facing?",
